{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEVERANCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Severance is a 2\u20135 player online co-op horror where one of you becomes the Ghost, and the rest must investigate, survive, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Play as The Ghost</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/d0f0f8fec2f936e65d35a3d0246fc0e5.poster.avif?t=1762158948\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/d0f0f8fec2f936e65d35a3d0246fc0e5.webm?t=1762158948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU</strong> are the ghost</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create terrifying moments, interact with the entire map to create unique scary scenarios, throw objects, lock doors, hunt and much more to mess with the investigators, all while draining their sanity, to allow you to begin hunts, chasing them down one by one until there are none left...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0e Play as the Investigator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/e7426a95e9ed2d26de4d97c01b777c85.poster.avif?t=1762158948\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/extras/e7426a95e9ed2d26de4d97c01b777c85.webm?t=1762158948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use classic paranormal tools  to gather real evidence on the ghost, find evidence to figure out who they really are. Be aware, they <strong>see</strong> and <strong>hear</strong> you. They will scare you to break you down, use this to your advantage as they will give evidence doing this</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7\u00a0<strong>Immersive Horror</strong><br>Severance features realistic visuals, environmental audio, and a minimal UI for total immersion. Every sound, shadow, and flicker could be a clue or a warning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\u00a0<strong>Signature Equipment</strong><br>Arm yourself with classic paranormal tools, EMF meters, Thermometers, and other unique devices\u00a0 such as possession dolls to uncover evidence and track the entity\u2019s movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d\u00a0<strong>True Co-op</strong><br>Success relies on teamwork. Share discoveries, and watch each other\u2019s backs, because you never know what the ghost will do next</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815750?t=1762158948","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/8fd40befc93cad4b27e0fa9419f4974c08436525/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762158948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/55d62cd68ee3c651ae0195840c486d9324415ca6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762158948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815750/55d62cd68ee3c651ae0195840c486d9324415ca6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762158948","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"